Third-party material
--------------------
Sansho contains no vendored third-party source code. The release binaries
include Sansho’s original sparse LU, ordering and dense QZ implementations and
link the Rust crates from Cargo.lock. Their license declarations, component
notices and full license texts are in THIRD-PARTY-LICENSES.md.

Any code ported from third-party projects (for example BSD-licensed parts of
ngspice) must be listed here together with its original copyright notice and
license, and recorded in docs/PROVENANCE.md.

